      </li>
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>
  <ThingDef ParentName="BedWithQualityBase">
    <defName>CVG_HealerBed</defName>
    <label>healer's bed</label>
    <description>A bed of pale wood with a bowl of herbs under the pillow and a ring of jade beads on the frame, laid out the way the healers of the Silent Lotus place their patients. The patient lies facing the door, the healer facing the patient, and nobody may speak above a whisper. It mends the sick faster than a plain bed, though nothing there is a machine.</description>
