  <ThingDef ParentName="TableGatherSpotBase">
    <defName>CVG_BanquetTable</defName>
    <label>banquet round table</label>
    <description>A round table big enough for twelve, with a lazy-susan of lacquered wood in the middle so that no guest has to reach for the dish. At a round table nobody sits at the head, which is the point: the sect's masters have been known to hold a council over rice just to avoid giving a seat of honor.</description>
