  <ThingDef ParentName="FurnitureWithQualityBase">
    <defName>CVG_CarvedChair</defName>
    <label>carved chair</label>
    <description>A high-backed chair of dark wood with a dragon carved in the back and a seat just wide enough for one cultivator in a wide-sleeved robe. The elders of the sects sit in it with their hands in their sleeves and their eyes closed, and nobody is quite sure which of the two things they are doing.</description>
