  <ThingDef ParentName="StorageShelfBase">
    <defName>CVG_WarehouseShelf</defName>
    <label>warehouse shelf</label>
    <description>A tall shelf of rough planks with stone feet, three arms wide, for the sect's stores: tools, cloth, medicines, anything that does not need a lock or a priest. Things on it do not rot. The Wandering Path cultivators insist that the only real storeroom is a pack, but they all take their things here when it rains.</description>
