  <ThingDef ParentName="FurnitureBase">
    <defName>CVG_GrainJar</defName>
    <label>grain jar</label>
    <description>A big, glazed clay jar with a wooden lid and a seal of red paper, for rice, millet and everything else the sect eats through winter. Food kept in it does not spoil and does not attract rats, which the old grain-keepers attribute to a small, bored spirit that lives in each jar and eats only the mice.</description>
