  <ThingDef ParentName="StorageShelfBase">
    <defName>CVG_SectChest</defName>
    <label>sect chest</label>
    <description>A heavy chest of camphor wood with brass corners, kept at the foot of the master's bed. Its lid carries the sect's seal, and the lock is a formation: it opens only for those whose qi it remembers. The chest of the Azure Peak was empty when the Calamity struck; the elders say that is how it was protected.</description>
