  <ThingDef Name="CVG_MoonDoor" ParentName="DoorBase">
    <defName>CVG_MoonDoor</defName>
    <label>moon door</label>
    <description>A round doorway with a double leaf, the kind seen in the gardens of the old Heavenly Court. Stepping through it is said to rid you of one worry, which is why gardeners build it wide: nobody carries only one. A closed moon door looks like a full moon rising out of the wall.</description>
