  <ThingDef ParentName="DoorBase">
    <defName>CVG_LacqueredDoor</defName>
    <label>lacquered door</label>
    <description>A double door of red lacquered wood with brass studs and a pair of stone lions on the sill, as the gates of every self-respecting sect since the First Convergence. It is sturdier than a plain door, and it makes visitors lower their voices without being asked.</description>
