  <ThingDef ParentName="Wall" MayRequire="prospero1088.convergence.resources">
    <defName>CVG_BambooWall</defName>
    <label>bamboo wall</label>
    <description>A wall of bamboo poles lashed side by side and plastered with a thin coat of clay. It goes up fast and costs almost nothing, holds a roof, and burns like a candle. The sect outposts of the Wandering Path use it because it can be rebuilt in a day, which they consider more important than lasting a century.</description>
