  <TerrainDef ParentName="FloorBase">
    <defName>CVG_RoofTileFloor</defName>
    <label>roof-tile floor</label>
    <description>Grey fired-clay roof tiles laid flat as paving, in the rippling pattern of the sect halls. Cheap, durable and pleasant underfoot in the rain, they are what the lanes between the pavilions are paved with. The first tiles were broken roofs that nobody had the heart to throw away.</description>
